  "question": {
    "text": "A solution is made by a concentrated solution of $\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NO}_{3}\\right)_{2}$ with a concentrated solution of $\\mathrm{NaNO}_{2}$ in $50 \\%$ acetic acid. A solution of a salt containing metal $\\mathrm{M}$ is added to the mixture, when a yellow precipitate is formed. Metal ' $\\mathrm{M}$ ' is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Magnesium",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Sodium",
      "is_correct": false
    },
